	)
	(text "22 Ω series resistors: source termination belongs at the driver, so\nTX (FPGA -> PHY) wants its resistors at the FPGA end and RX (PHY -> FPGA) at the PHY end.\nThis board stands both columns beside the PHY (the TX ones move to the FPGA in rev B)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 80.01 53.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b1302133-1703-c3e7-d4f9-d99b150c2b82")
	)
	(text "Bob Smith termination; the jack's shield goes to the same ground.\nThe magnetics are the isolation (IEEE 802.3); this 1 nF / 3 kV 1812\nis the designed bridge across it. The board has not been hipot-tested."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 285.75 278.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8209055-4135-5425-5e1d-4643d6a9b58f")
	)
	(text "U401 RTL8211F-CG: one chip, drawn as RGMII side (A), line side (B) and power (C)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133.35 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b8c41042-37dd-0f79-70dd-b4bfb13e694f")
	)
	(text "internal 1.0 V switcher output: feeds only this chip; the inductor must take 600 mA (a power inductor, not a chip one)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 298.45 0)
		(effects
